    {
      "source": "A bundle of key and trust managers that can be used to establish an SSL connection.\nInstances are usually created <a href=\"#from(org.springframework.boot.ssl.SslStoreBundle,org.springframework.boot.ssl.SslBundleKey)\"><code>from</code></a> an\n<a href=\"SslStoreBundle.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.ssl\"><code>SslStoreBundle</code></a>.",
      "translation": "一组可用于建立 SSL 连接的密钥和信任管理器。实例通常由 <a href=\"#from(org.springframework.boot.ssl.SslStoreBundle,org.springframework.boot.ssl.SslBundleKey)\"><code>from</code></a> 方法创建，该方法接收一个 <a href=\"SslStoreBundle.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.ssl\"><code>SslStoreBundle</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/javax/net/ssl/TrustManagerFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.net.ssl\"><code>TrustManagerFactory</code></a> used to establish trust.",
      "translation": "返回用于建立信任的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/javax/net/ssl/TrustManagerFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.net.ssl\"><code>TrustManagerFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Return the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/javax/net/ssl/TrustManager.html\" title=\"class or interface in javax.net.ssl\"><code>TrustManager</code></a> instances used to establish trust.",
